; audit-evidence-cells-band.fk - durable Form cells over real evidence JSON.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/json.fk form-stdlib/audit-evidence-cells.fk

; Band verdict on fkwu today: 544 — and that is the honest reading of an absent corpus,
; not a partial pass. Re-read 2026-07-25.
;
; A line I wrote here earlier on 2026-07-25 said "1023 when every check lands — DERIVED
; from the bit weights". That was a sum of the weights below, not a witness of anything,
; and it framed 544 as a failure. Measured since:
;
;   docs/system_audit/ is not in this working tree, and no path under it — and no file
;   named *commit_evidence* — appears anywhere in this repository's history. Checked
;   against the FULL history (the clone was shallow at 73 commits; un-shallowed to 937
;   before asking). (aec-system-audit-count "..") is 0 and the whole tree holds 29 .json
;   files, against the >600 this band asks for.
;
; So the corpus these cells parse is Coherence-Network tissue that never traveled into
; this body — the same ground json-lens-tending-band already names in its own header.
; 544 = 512 + 32: the two checks that do not touch the corpus (the summary is well-formed,
; and its next-release string reads back). The other eight are PENDING A CORPUS, not
; failing. The cells themselves are unproven here because there is nothing here to prove
; them against.
;
; What would be dishonest: authoring a commit_evidence_*.json to make this green. The
; band asserts a specific real commit's date and scope — writing that file would be
; manufacturing the very evidence it claims to witness. Re-pointing the cells at a corpus
; this body does hold is a different band, and the commons owner's call.
;
(do
    (let cells (aec-load-cells-from-root ".."))
    (let cell
        (aec-find-cell-by-source
            cells
            "docs/system_audit/commit_evidence_2026-06-07_json_lens_tending.json"))
    (let summary (aec-tending-from-root ".."))

    (add
        (add
            (add
                (if (aec-evidence-cell? cell) 1 0)
                (if (str_eq (aec-date cell) "2026-06-07") 2 0))
            (add
                (if (str_eq (aec-commit-scope cell) "Add Form JSON lens tending and evidence cell proof") 4 0)
                (if (aec-pass? cell) 8 0)))
        (add
            (add
                (if (aec-phase-held? cell) 16 0)
                (if (aec-summary? summary) 32 0))
            (add
                (if (gt (aec-summary-total-json summary) 600) 64 0)
                (add
                    (if (gt (aec-summary-loaded-cells summary) 600) 128 0)
                    (add
                        (if (gt (aec-summary-pass-count summary) 100) 256 0)
                        (if (str_eq (aec-summary-next-release summary) "persist dynamic commit evidence cell index and compress repeated proof fields") 512 0)))))))
